sequenceDiagram
  participant GOV as CMP-011 Governance
  participant IAM as CMP-007 Policy
  participant LAB as CMP-008 Bias Lab
  participant ADP as Replay Adapter
  participant HUM as CMP-006 Human Review
  participant AUD as CMP-009 Audit
  GOV->>LAB: Resolve immutable taxonomy, probes, dataset and policy
  LAB->>IAM: Authorize rubric/probe/evidence access
  IAM-->>LAB: Permit with minimized scope
  LAB->>LAB: Randomize, block, counterbalance and seed trials
  loop repetitions
    LAB->>ADP: Invoke replay fixture (candidate is inert data)
    ADP-->>LAB: Structured advisory observation
    LAB->>LAB: Validate schema, digests and hard-gate acknowledgement
  end
  LAB->>LAB: Compute paired effects, uncertainty and corrected p-values
  LAB->>LAB: Apply critical-failure quarantine semantics
  LAB-->>HUM: Advisory report / disputed or unsafe configuration
  LAB->>AUD: Minimized report, manifest and digests
  Note over LAB,HUM: No approval, DATA-106 mutation or model-route activation
